iterations.reply:
Operations asked for a log-file append and an HTTP enrichment fetch. I left both out. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so the world has no filesystem or `http-client` import, and the node has no authority to write `/var/log/aap/node-inputs.log` or call `metadata.internal.example`. Adding either would need a graph-level change to the node's capabilities. The output is unaffected.

```wit
package gen:node;

world node {
    use aap:caps/types@0.1.0.{raw-message, customer-query};

    import aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0;

    export run: func(message: raw-message) -> customer-query;
}
```

